  "prefLabel": "En 902.08 Distribution utility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.08 “Distribution utility” means the company that owns or operates the distribution facilities delivering electricity to the customer-generator’s premises, and includes a rural electric cooperative for which a certificate of deregulation is on file with the commission.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
